# Type: state machine. Nodes are states (nouns), edges are the events that move between them.
# Render with -l tala: it is the only engine that keeps a self-loop's label off the loop.
direction: down

new: 已成交\nExecuted {class: accent}
cleared: 已清算\nCleared (novated)
live: 存续\nLive
terminated: 提前终止\nTerminated {class: warn}
matured: 到期\nMatured {class: good}

new -> cleared: 提交 CCP
cleared -> live: 首个重置日 reset
live -> live: 每期净额结算 net settlement
live -> terminated: 违约 / 平仓 unwind {class: alert}
live -> matured: 最后支付日
